OL,3,ATrump says US will form 'AI Force' and
OL,4,Aappoint an artificial intelligence tsar
OL,5,
OL,6,FUS President Donald Trump has announced
OL,7,Fthat he will form an "AI Force" and
OL,8,Fappoint an artificial intelligence tsar
OL,9,Famid warnings about the emergent
OL,10,Ftechnology.
OL,12,FIn a social media post on Saturday, he
OL,13,Fsaid his administration "will not in
OL,14,Fany way hinder or stifle the growth" of
OL,15,Fthe industry, and pushed back against
OL,16,Fcalls to slow down the development of
OL,17,FAI until better safeguards are put in
OL,18,Fplace.
OL,23,APub: 19-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,316,300,200,140,0,100
