OL,3,ATrump says US will form 'AI Force' and
OL,4,Aappoint an artificial intelligence tsar
OL,5,
OL,6,FHis post came as a slew of warnings
OL,7,Fabout the potential dangers of AI have
OL,8,Fspurred calls for coordinated action on
OL,9,Fthe technology's development.
OL,11,FTrump offered no details or a timeline
OL,12,Ffor his plan.
